{"id":"1191b8d1afa11034","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-sublinear.md","title":"Sublinear Functional","display":"df-sublinear — Sublinear Functional","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sublinear","aliases":["58-df-sublinear","Sublinear Functional"],"display":"df-sublinear — Sublinear Functional","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sublinear"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sublinear</span><span>Sublinear Functional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sublinear — Sublinear Functional"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,+,\\odot,p,f\\in V\">\\(X,+,\\odot,p,f\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+,\\odot)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+,\\odot)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sublinear}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Majorizes}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sublinear}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Majorizes}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sublinear\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,X,+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+,\\odot)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(p(x+y)\\leq p(x)+p(y))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(p(\\alpha\\odot x)=\\alpha p(x))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sublinear\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,X,+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+,\\odot)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(p(x+y)\\leq p(x)+p(y))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(p(\\alpha\\odot x)=\\alpha p(x))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sublinear\\text{-}majorization} \\vdash \\operatorname{Majorizes}(p,f,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(f(x)\\leq p(x))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sublinear\\text{-}majorization} \\vdash \\operatorname{Majorizes}(p,f,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(f(x)\\leq p(x))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sublinear: triangle inequality + positive homogeneity</li>\n<li>A seminorm is sublinear and absolutely homogeneous, equivalently in the real case sublinear with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(-x)=p(x)\">\\(p(-x)=p(x)\\)</span>; adding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(x)=0\\Rightarrow x=0\">\\(p(x)=0\\Rightarrow x=0\\)</span> gives a norm.</li>\n<li>Hahn-Banach extension statements belong in theorem files.</li>\n<li>Minkowski functional: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(x) = \\inf\\{\\lambda &gt; 0 : x \\in \\lambda K\\}\">\\(p(x) = \\inf\\{\\lambda &gt; 0 : x \\in \\lambda K\\}\\)</span> for convex <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span></li>\n<li>The vector-space and function predicates now expose the exact source arities, fixing the scalar action and codomain used by both subadditivity and majorization.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,+,\\odot,p,f\\in V$, with $\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+,\\odot)$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,+,\\odot,p,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sublinear}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Majorizes}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sublinear\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,X,+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+,\\odot)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(p(x+y)\\leq p(x)+p(y))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(p(\\alpha\\odot x)=\\alpha p(x))","display":true},{"te